  m_text: '<size=120%><b>NYP Cloud Comp OH Game</b></size>

    <color=#9DB4E0>Open
    House Credits</color>



    <size=110%><color=#FFD25A><b>ART TEAM</b></color></size>


    <color=#FFD25A>Cornelius</color>

    Map
    Artist

    Created the entire set of map assets


    <color=#FFD25A>Jing Heng</color>

    UI
    Artist

    UI assets, home screen and credit screen

    Helped design the map
    layout


    <color=#FFD25A>Bez</color>

    Map Designer

    Helped design
    the map layout


    <color=#FFD25A>Phoebe</color>

    UI Artist

    Quest
    UI, login and home screen


    <color=#FFD25A>Szeyee</color>

    UI Artist

    Credit
    screen


    <color=#FFD25A>Veilun</color>

    Minigame Artist

    Made the
    art for the File Transfer Game



    <size=110%><color=#FFD25A><b>DEV TEAM</b></color></size>


    <color=#FFD25A>Wei
    Li</color>

    LLM Minigame & Dialogue System

    Designed the whole LLM minigame
    concept and UI layout

    Drew all of its art assets

    Coded the AI minigame
    system, API connection and UI animations

    Wrote the AI system prompt and
    behaviour rules

    Designed and coded the dialogue system


    <color=#FFD25A>Denni</color>

    Lead
    Integrator & Harness Game

    Quest system and Cloud Network meter

    Profile
    creation screen for certificates

    Sign-up and Firebase player data

    Combined
    all the minigames, the lobby and the map into one game

    Harness Game


    <color=#FFD25A>Pushkal</color>

    API
    Developer

    LLM minigame API connection


    <color=#FFD25A>Zongrong</color>

    Gameplay
    Programmer

    Player movement, camera follow and interaction system


    <color=#FFD25A>Szeyee</color>

    Gameplay
    Programmer

    Minimap and pause menu


    <color=#FFD25A>Veilun</color>

    Minigame
    Developer

    File Transfer minigame



    <color=#9DB4E0>Made by NYP students
    for the NYP Open House</color>

'
